    - target: {fileID: 4711005256018735203, guid: 0daf8292e6fd6cf46a68c89d3a946ace, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Ocean Paddlers is a 2 Player local Multiplayer Game, Developed as the
        mmp2a project (Required by the fh-Salzburg), in a group of 2, Expanded upon
        in Private.


        Gameplay:

        2 Players navigate a raft through
        a river Avoiding obstacles and collecting eggs in a progressivly generating
        Map.


        What i did:

        Most art

        Most code (AI, Controlls,
        Map Generation, Collisions, Gamestate, Point tracking, Particle systems,
        ...)

        Level Design


        Made with:

        CPP, SFML, Tiled, 
        semi-selfmade Engine

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
